    "title": "$100K Winning Scratch-Off Sold at 7-Eleven - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paige Wuthrich ,\n17 hours ago According to the Maryland Lottery, a Takoma Park man won the $100,000 top prize on a scratch-off ticket purchased late at night at the 7-Eleven on 9151 Riggs Road in Adelphi. The player, who frequently purchases scratch-offs, stated that after playing several games, he concluded the ticket was a winner and later confirmed the award using the Maryland Lottery app. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
